SUMMARY:Silent Reading Club
DESCRIPTION:Love books but hate the “homework” of a traditional book club? Welcome to the Silent Reading Club at Glass Jug Downtown – the most social way to be antisocial! \nThe concept is simple: No assigned reading. No pressure. Simply bring a book of your choice to read in our space and grab a drink from the bar. Find a place to sit and dig in.
