DESCRIPTION:By popular demand\, The Velvet Hippo has added 2nd\, 4th\, and sometimes 5th Friday DJ dance parties to our weekend roster! Shift into weekend mode as DJs including Lex Nell\, DJ Nar\, and Jorden The DJ get the vibes right and keep the dance floor jumpin. With the Friday Night Shift\, First Friday Last Night\, and Femme 3rd Fridays\, you always know where to find the party downtown on Friday nights. Drink specials\, no cover\, 21+ with valid ID to enter.
