SUMMARY:Golden Glow Wellness Weekend at Boomerang Pilates
DESCRIPTION:Golden Glow Weekend with MARA Beauty X Siobhanie Rose Esthetics X POSA \nTwo days of movement\, glow\, and gut health. Saturday pairs a 50-minute mat class with a clean skincare sample pack from MARA Beauty and a facial sculpting & lymphatic gua sha tutorial with Siobhanie Rose Esthetics. Sunday pairs mat with a gut health & anti-inflammation talk and demo from POSA\, plus a fresh turmeric booster shot. Grab the 2-day pass to lock in both days at a bundled price. Members can book using their existing membership (2 credits each day).
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/golden-glow-wellness-weekend-at-boomerang-pilates/
