SUMMARY:Sage Advice with Author Dawn Leith Dougherty
DESCRIPTION:A fun\, practical introduction to energetic smoke cleansing for your home nad sacred space. \nLearn how plants and tree resins can be blended into smoke baths\, potpourri\, and incense for your spiritual practice. Dawn will cover the why and the how of smoke cleansing (or “smudging”)\, plus simple everyday practices for people of all ages\, cultures\, and paths. Weather permitting\, we’ll step outside for a smoke bath. \nYour ticket includes a signed copy of Dawn’s book\, Sage Advice: A Practical Guide to Energetic. Smoke Cleansing and House Blessing. Her incense blends will be available in the shop.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/sage-advice-with-author-dawn-leith-dougherty/
LOCATION:Fate & Folklore\, 123 Market Street\, Durham\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Classes & Workshops,Spiritual/Religious
