SUMMARY:Carolina Gayniacs Hurricanes Hockey Watch Parties
DESCRIPTION:The Carolina Gayniacs will be in house for select Canes games this fall! Join this inclusive LGBTQ+ Carolina Hurricanes hockey fan group to cheer on our favorite team on Oct 29th\, Nov 14th\, and Dec 13th. Let’s celebrate the wins and commiserate with the losses over a pint\, cocktail\, NA bev\, or our award-winning THC strawberry lemonade. And of course\, we’ll be playing all games all season long on the big projector screen. LETS GO CANES! \nView on Facebook.
