SUMMARY:Alley Twenty Six Ardbeg BBQ
DESCRIPTION:Saturdays in the fall are perfect for Ardbeg whisky cocktails and BBQ! Alley Twenty Six owner Shannon Healy will be mixing up some cocktails featuring Ardbeg whiskies and our new chef Adam Guillet will be smoking pigs in the alley for the occasion. Make a reservation and pay for your ticket at the door. Each ticket includes a choice of one cocktail and a plate of BBQ with sides and cornbread (vegetarian option available). Price is $35\, not including taxes and gratuity. The Ardbeg folks will be on hand to offer tastings of different Ardbeg expressions and offer up tidbits of knowledge. This is an event you won’t want to miss!
