SUMMARY:Opera FM
DESCRIPTION:Experience opera’s golden age. A live orchestra\, a theatrical radio host\, and all the drama. \nFrom the elegant streets of Spain to the bustling boulevards of Paris and the grand opera houses of Italy\, Opera FM brings together some of the most unforgettable characters ever set to music. Tune in to opera’s biggest emotions\, inspired by the golden age of vintage radio. \nYou’ll hear the sparkle and sophistication of Rossini’s beloved barber\, the youthful charm of Donizetti’s regiment\, the bittersweet yearnings of Puccini and Weill\, and the fiery passions of Verdi’s immortal heroes. \nDon’t touch that dial\, now.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/opera-fm/
LOCATION:Carolina Theatre of Durham\, 309 W Morgan St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Concert
